Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:10:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] docs(post): Carvera names the open hazard after M6; PR
 refs issue 1616

The review of a1833e52 requested two changes.

1. The Carvera claim was overstated. After M6 the Carvera still moves
   X/Y at the exit height of the changer. No source that we read
   confirms that height. The comment in carvera.cps and the decision
   file now say that the hazard of issue 1614 stays for the Carvera
   after M6 until a public source confirms the M6 exit position.
   The new test the_carvera_script_names_the_open_hazard_after_its_tool_change
   keeps that note in the script.

2. The PR does not close issue 1616. The decision file says that the
   Fanuc family (issue 1633) and the Carvera after M6 stay open.

No change to posted output.

Refs #1616

